SUMMARY:🎃 Family FUNtaz Night!
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of spooktacular fun at the Children’s Museum of Sonoma County! Family FUNtaz Night\, Thursday & Friday\, October 22\, 4:30pm to 8:00pm & October 23\, 3:00pm to 8:00pm\, is the perfect way to celebrate spooky season. Come for thrills\, giggles\, and plenty of memory-making with your family! \n\n\n\n\nMore information on the Family FUN Nights page!\n\n\n\n\nHere’s what’s brewing: \n\n\n\n\n🍺 Tasty brews and Local wines for the grown-ups (available for purchase)\n\n\n\n🍔 Delicious eats from local food trucks (available for purchase)\n\n\n\n🎶 Rockin’ tunes\n\n\n\n🎨 Hands-on spooky crafts\, creepy science experiments\, and silly surprises from our classic FUNtazmagoria weekend\n\n\n\n👻 Costumes encouraged—kids\, parents\, and even grandparents\, come dressed in your Halloween best!\n\n\n\n\nBring the whole family for a magical evening of pumpkins\, potions\, music\, and mayhem! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNote: Classic FUNtazmagoria is transforming in 2026 and 2027 as the Children’s Museum undergoes its exciting expansion project. During this time\, we invite families to join us for two evenings of Family FUNtaz Night\, on Thursday & Friday\, October 22\, 4:30pm to 8:00pm & October 23\, 3:00pm to 8:00pm! Museum will closed from 9:00am to the start of the Family Fun Night events.
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/%f0%9f%8e%83-family-funtaz-night/
CATEGORIES:Special Hours,All Ages
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.cmosc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Webpage-2.webp
END:VEVENT
