SUMMARY:Chess Club
DESCRIPTION:Build strategy\, sharpen focus\, and have fun this fall with Chess Club at the Children’s Museum of Sonoma County! This engaging after-school program introduces players of all levels to the fundamentals of chess while encouraging critical thinking\, patience\, and friendly competition. \n\n\n\n\nSign up\n\n\n\nSee details\n\n\n\n\nOctober Schedule: Every Wednesday\, after schoolDates: October 7\, 14\, 21\, 28October Time: 3:00 – 4:30 PM (Drop-off as early as 2:30)
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/chess-club/2026-10-28/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.cmosc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Chess-Club-For-Sawyer_1060x768-1.webp
END:VEVENT
