 childhood and continues her study of childhood and music/movement trainings. Colors of Spanish provides workshops for teachers\, librarians and caregivers and hosts Spanish story time with music & movement programs at local schools\, libraries\, and museums. www.colorsofspanish.org \n\n\n\nDesigned for kids 1-5\, families\, and siblings. \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nGenerously sponsored by RCU and the SABA Foundation.
